{"about_the_game":"This is a <strong>road trip</strong> game in an almost <strong>infinite</strong> random generated <strong>desert</strong>. The focus is on <strong>freedom</strong>, <strong>driving</strong>, <strong>exploration</strong> and <strong>immersion</strong>. It has <strong>minimal</strong> car <strong>maintenance</strong> and <strong>survival</strong> elements.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Desert, Freedom and Driving:</h2><br>There are <strong>no invisible walls</strong> or <strong>unable to jump over</strong> small fences, or <strong>blinking red &quot;wrong direction&quot; signs</strong> on the hud. The car won't need <i>10-20</i> liter <strong>fuel</strong> over just only a <strong>few hundred meters</strong>, with a full tank, you could go approximately <strong><i>500</i> kilometers</strong>. If you see a <strong>distant big mountain</strong>, you can <strong>go there</strong> and if you are capable, you can climb it. If you don't like where the <strong>mirrors</strong> are facing you can <strong>adjust</strong> them however you want or <strong>throw</strong> them away while driving at <strong>full speed</strong>. If you want to <strong>lean</strong> out of the car, or closer to the radio or near anything, <i>you can</i>.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1017180?t=1751568928","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1017180/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751568928","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1017180/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751568928","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1017180/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751568928","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Coop/Multiplayer Current State</h1><p></p><br><h1>Few videos you may want to watch</h1><p><br><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>This is a <strong>road trip</strong> game in an almost <strong>infinite</strong> random generated <strong>desert</strong>. The focus is on <strong>freedom</strong>, <strong>driving</strong>, <strong>exploration</strong> and <strong>immersion</strong>. It has <strong>minimal</strong> car <strong>maintenance</strong> and <strong>survival</strong> elements.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Desert, Freedom and Driving:</h2><br>There are <strong>no invisible walls</strong> or <strong>unable to jump over</strong> small fences, or <strong>blinking red &quot;wrong direction&quot; signs</strong> on the hud. The car won't need <i>10-20</i> liter <strong>fuel</strong> over just only a <strong>few hundred meters</strong>, with a full tank, you could go approximately <strong><i>500</i> kilometers</strong>. If you see a <strong>distant big mountain</strong>, you can <strong>go there</strong> and if you are capable, you can climb it. If you don't like where the <strong>mirrors</strong> are facing you can <strong>adjust</strong> them however you want or <strong>throw</strong> them away while driving at <strong>full speed</strong>. If you want to <strong>lean</strong> out of the car, or closer to the radio or near anything, <i>you can</i>.","developers":["Genesz"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1017180/header.jpg?t=1751568928","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1017180/444964/7db595f118bf90dc4f3898a0e35b65893b19dc56/1750606784/dash_av1.mpd?t=1646577435","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1017